('Guide','IE',"Welcome to the Lantern Craft Centre. The building used to be a storage depot, but the rooms now support several different kinds of making. It is important to remember that some people here are at work rather than taking part in a demonstration. Please look for the open-door symbol before entering a room, and do not assume that an unlocked door is an invitation to walk in."),
