('Guide','IE',"The gallery takes a different approach. Instead of showing only finished pieces, it displays drawings, early attempts and revised designs beside them. We hope visitors will see that changes are part of making, not evidence that a maker failed to plan. Some objects were altered because the first version was awkward to hold. Others changed because a material did not behave as expected. The labels explain the particular decision rather than presenting every change as a general rule."),
