('Owen','CA',"The measuring procedure will be agreed with the tutor beforehand. We also want participants to be able to stop at any point. We shouldn't treat completing every model as a condition of helping us. If a person finds the activity uncomfortable, we'll stop rather than encourage them to continue for the sake of complete data."),
('Tutor','GB',"Exactly. What will your result look like? Be cautious about turning a small set of observations into a precise ranking that appears more certain than your evidence allows."),
