('Owen','CA',"Our final drawing will show a possible revision, with notes explaining which observations influenced it. We'll label it a proposal, not a validated product. Questions about durability, cleaning and actual drinking use would need a different study. Those are outside our current exercise, even if the proposed shape looks convincing."),
